Scenario "resize_roundtrip_preserves_input"
Command "CARGO_BIN_EXE_maqi"
Terminal rows 6 cols 24
Cursor row 1 col 1

Step "start at the top of the screen"
WaitFrontendLineStartsWith "maqi>" timeout 5000ms
Settle 0ms
Expect:
